      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-85426",
      ":question/problem": "Which of the following probabilities could be approximated using the Poisson approximation of the binomial distribution?\n\n1. The probability of getting seven $1$s on $200$ rolls of a $24$-sided die.\n2. The probability of getting $5$ heads on $30$ flips of a coin.\n3. The probability of getting a defective lightbulb in a package of $6$ if $3%$ of lightbulbs are defective."
